# 7DTD Vanilla+ Mod Pack

## Game Version

7 Days to Die V3.1.0

## Mods

- AGF BackpackPlus 60
- Craft From Containers
- Simple HP Bar V2

## Installation

Copy the Mods folder into:

Windows
Steam\steamapps\common\7 Days To Die\Mods

Server
/serverdata/serverfiles/Mods

Launch without Easy Anti Cheat.